    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u89c1\u8be1\u5f55\uff1a\u9634\u9b42\u8857 Haunting Record: Phantom Street",
    "steam_appid": 3387330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;</i>Haunting Record: Phantom Street<i>&quot;</i> is a horror-themed walking simulator filled with fear and suspense. You step into a street both strange and familiar, where eerie events unfold one after another. The air is thick with lingering spirits and overwhelming resentment, as if something in the shadows is waiting to drag you into the abyss\u2026 With terror and the unknown closing in, will you break free from their grasp, or will you slowly lose yourself in the darkness?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notice:</strong><br>Playtime is about 1.5 to 2 hours. There are unavoidable jump scares and disturbing scenes. If you're sensitive to this type of content, please be careful.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core mechanic of the game is &quot;spotting anomalies&quot;: as you advance down the path, carefully observe your surroundings and determine whether what you see is normal. If everything appears ordinary, turn left; if you notice anything strange or unsettling, turn right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is far from a simple observation game. As your journey deepens, you will face intense and thrilling chases, explore twisted and bizarre &quot;Core of the Pool&quot; scenes, confront your chaotic inner self, or navigate through endless labyrinths in search of a sliver of hope. Each scene intertwines with the protagonist's forgotten and distorted memories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four distinct level styles: From eerie anomaly-spotting environments to symbolic and metaphorical spiritual worlds, each level offers a completely unique experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse gameplay: Beyond spotting anomalies, you\u2019ll explore the unknown, make crucial decisions, and find your way through intricate mazes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unique endings: The story unfolds in four different directions based on your choices. Will you uncover the entire truth, or will you sink into endless oblivion?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive atmosphere: Combining sound design, lighting, and environmental storytelling to deliver a deeply immersive horror experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: 1.5 to 2 hours or more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains unavoidable jump scares and  horror imagery. Please proceed with caution if you are sensitive to such elements.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;</i>Haunting Record: Phantom Street<i>&quot;</i> is a horror-themed walking simulator filled with fear and suspense. You step into a street both strange and familiar, where eerie events unfold one after another. The air is thick with lingering spirits and overwhelming resentment, as if something in the shadows is waiting to drag you into the abyss\u2026 With terror and the unknown closing in, will you break free from their grasp, or will you slowly lose yourself in the darkness?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notice:</strong><br>Playtime is about 1.5 to 2 hours. There are unavoidable jump scares and disturbing scenes. If you're sensitive to this type of content, please be careful.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core mechanic of the game is &quot;spotting anomalies&quot;: as you advance down the path, carefully observe your surroundings and determine whether what you see is normal. If everything appears ordinary, turn left; if you notice anything strange or unsettling, turn right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is far from a simple observation game. As your journey deepens, you will face intense and thrilling chases, explore twisted and bizarre &quot;Core of the Pool&quot; scenes, confront your chaotic inner self, or navigate through endless labyrinths in search of a sliver of hope. Each scene intertwines with the protagonist's forgotten and distorted memories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four distinct level styles: From eerie anomaly-spotting environments to symbolic and metaphorical spiritual worlds, each level offers a completely unique experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse gameplay: Beyond spotting anomalies, you\u2019ll explore the unknown, make crucial decisions, and find your way through intricate mazes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unique endings: The story unfolds in four different directions based on your choices. Will you uncover the entire truth, or will you sink into endless oblivion?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive atmosphere: Combining sound design, lighting, and environmental storytelling to deliver a deeply immersive horror experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: 1.5 to 2 hours or more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains unavoidable jump scares and  horror imagery. Please proceed with caution if you are sensitive to such elements.</p></li></ul>",
